  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks and place on the lined oven tray. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e10d971405a9ee1f347f/step-6740cb00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion. Drain sweetcorn. Grate carrot. Using a paper towel, squeeze out any moisture from the carrot.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• In a medium bowl, combine corn, carrot, cooked onion, pesto-flavoured powder, Cheddar cheese, the plain flour, egg, milk and a pinch of pepper (if it’s too wet, add more flour).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e10d971405a9ee1f347f/step-6c62f210.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return pan to medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook heaped spoonfuls of fritter mixture, flattening with a spatula, until golden, 3-4 mins each side (don’t flip too early!). You should get 3-4 fritters per person. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e10d971405a9ee1f347f/step-c76c6d20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato. In a second medium bowl, combine the honey and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Add tomato and salad leaves and toss to coat. Season to taste.\n• Divide fritters, potatoes and salad between plates.\n• Serve with dill & parsley mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6859e10d971405a9ee1f347f/step-59751f30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
